OL,3,ATrump $1 coin makes him first living
OL,4,Apresident on US currency in a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe law bans living presidents from
OL,7,Fappearing on US currency, but a design
OL,8,Fclause in legislation for the
OL,9,Fanniversary was used to overcome this.
